  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your sous-vide machine to 180°F (82°C).",
    "In a large clay tagine or Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, paprika, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the wine, lemon juice, and lemongrass to the tagine. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the shredded red cabbage to the tagine, stirring to coat with the wine mixture.",
    "Cover the tagine with a lid and bring to a simmer.",
    "Transfer the tagine to the preheated sous-vide machine and cook for 2 hours.",
    "Remove the tagine from the sous-vide machine and serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro or parsley, if desired."
